      "text": "All in a day’s work for our team in Fresno! These apprehensions underscore the critical role of our partnership with @ICEgov in safeguarding American communities.\n▪️ Criminal Alien 1: Entered the U.S. without inspection and has a history of four prior arrests, including DUI, possession/purchase/sale of narcotics, and driving without a license.\n▪️ Criminal Alien 2: Previously arrested for inflicting corporal injury on a spouse/cohabitant and convicted of battery.\n▪️ Criminal Alien 3: Arrest history includes battery on a spouse/cohabitant, DUI, and possession of a controlled substance, with prior convictions for domestic violence, stalking, and child abuse.",
